cff-version: 1.2.0

message: "If you use this software or research in your work, please cite this repository and the associated Master's thesis."

type: software
license: MIT

title: "Equity Forecasting with Deep Learning"

authors:
  - family-names: "Delos"
    given-names: "Marc"

abstract: "Applied AI/ML research comparing LSTM, N-BEATS, and TSFEDL deep-learning models with simple baselines for one-step-ahead hourly forecasting of a synthetic equity basket. Models are evaluated using regression accuracy, directional prediction, and simulated trading-oriented metrics."

repository-code: "https://github.com/marcdp/equity-forecasting-ai"

keywords:
